{
 "_comment": "承認の仕方を金額で決める例題。100万円未満なら直属の上司が承認、100万円以上なら承認グループ（鈴木・山本・田中の3人）の多数決で承認する。**代替節が金額で選ばれ**、高額側は量化(quant) = majority で判定する（追記318）。",
 "@id": "urn:kapp:ontology",
 "@type": "Ontology",
 "agentProperty": "urn:kapp:agent",
 "defines": [
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Template",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "wam:isComplete",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "テンプレート",
    "en": "Template"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Atom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Template"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "アトムノード",
    "en": "Atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Task",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "タスクノード",
    "en": "Task"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Goal",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Task"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "ゴール",
    "en": "Goal"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Constraint",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "制約ノード",
    "en": "Constraint"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:OtherAtom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "その他のアトムノード",
    "en": "Other atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "wam:isComplete",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "domain": "urn:kapp:Template",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "完成",
    "en": "Is complete"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Person",
   "@type": "Class",
   "label": {
    "ja": "人",
    "en": "Person"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:agent",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kapp:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "担当者",
    "en": "Agent"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:refersTo",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "参照",
    "en": "RefersTo"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Geq",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Constraint"
   ],
   "builtInFunction": "≧",
   "isConstraint": true,
   "label": {
    "ja": "≧",
    "en": "AtLeast"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Then",
   "@type": "Class",
   "linkKind": "then",
   "label": {
    "ja": "Then",
    "en": "Then"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg1",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第1引数",
    "en": "Arg 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg2",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第2引数",
    "en": "Arg 2"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:注文者",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kapp:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "注文者",
    "en": "Orderer"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:金額",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "金額",
    "en": "Amount"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:承認者",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kapp:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認者",
    "en": "Approver"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:注文",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "wam:completeByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "注文",
    "en": "Order"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "承認は1段ぶんのタスク。担当者は経路のその段の承認者であり、ホーン節には書かれていない——データから流れてくる。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:承認",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "wam:completeByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:差戻し先",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認",
    "en": "Approve"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:発注",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "wam:completeByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "発注",
    "en": "PlaceOrder"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:購買",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:OtherAtom",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:注文者",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:会社",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "購買",
    "en": "Purchase"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:購買ゴール",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Goal"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "購買ゴール",
    "en": "Purchase goal"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:Gt",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:Constraint"
   ],
   "builtInFunction": ">",
   "isConstraint": true,
   "label": {
    "ja": ">",
    "en": "GreaterThan"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "量化を書く属性（追記318・344・348）。**ノードごとに書く**——同じ述語でも本体によって全員・過半数と書き分ける。**直に書かず、下位属性で閾値の種類を表す**——`量化` の maxCardinality を1にすることで「1つの制限ノードに閾値は1つ」が構造として言える（`isComplete` と同じ手。追記249）。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:quant",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "量化",
    "en": "Quantification"
   },
   "maxCardinality": 1
  },
  {
   "_comment": "n件以上（Geq）。整数なので「n件超」は「n+1件以上」と書ける。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:quantCount",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:kapp:quant",
   "range": "integer",
   "label": {
    "ja": "量化:個数",
    "en": "Quantification: count"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "全件。**値は真のみ**——量化しないなら属性ごと省く。⚠️ 候補が0件なら真（空虚な真）であり、割合100%とは違う。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:quantAll",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:kapp:quant",
   "range": "boolean",
   "label": {
    "ja": "量化:全員",
    "en": "Quantification: all"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "その割合**以上**。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:quantRatioGeq",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:kapp:quant",
   "range": "double",
   "label": {
    "ja": "量化:割合以上",
    "en": "Quantification: ratio (Geq)"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "その割合**超**。**過半数は `0.5`** である（追記346——過半数は狭義の割合の特別な場合にすぎない）。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:quantRatioGt",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:kapp:quant",
   "range": "double",
   "label": {
    "ja": "量化:割合超",
    "en": "Quantification: ratio (Gt)"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:グループ",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "グループ",
    "en": "Group"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kapp:構成員",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kapp:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "構成員",
    "en": "Member"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "誰がどのグループに属するか（業務データ）。頭部だけ・本体が空のホーン節＝事実である。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:所属",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:構成員",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:グループ",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "isConstraint": true,
   "label": {
    "ja": "所属",
    "en": "Membership"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "直属の上司（業務データ）。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:上司",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:注文者",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:承認者",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "上司",
    "en": "Supervisor"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "承認の仕方。**節は2本**で、金額で選ばれる（代替節。Tag: 3-E）。100万円未満なら直属の上司、100万円以上なら承認グループの多数決。",
   "@id": "urn:kapp:承認の仕方",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kapp:OtherAtom",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kapp:注文者",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認の仕方",
    "en": "ApprovalScheme"
   }
  }
 ]
}
